



3.5. Data Flow Diagram (DFD)
3.5.1. Overview

The Data Flow Diagram (DFD) illustrates how data moves through the AR-IMMS system, from infrastructure devices in the Mini Data Center to the Collector Agent, Backend, Database, Alert Engine, Web Dashboard, and Mobile AR application.

The DFD focuses on the main data flows of the system, including telemetry collection, data processing, persistent storage, anomaly detection, alert generation, and real-time data delivery to client applications.

